# CPU microcode (Intel + AMD) and open-source GPU drivers (Intel, AMD, and
# the Nouveau open driver for Nvidia — works out of the box, but is
# noticeably slower than Nvidia's proprietary driver for gaming/3D).
# See hooks/normal/0500-nvidia-proprietary-note.hook.chroot for why the
# proprietary Nvidia driver isn't baked into the ISO itself.

intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
firmware-linux
firmware-misc-nonfree
firmware-realtek
firmware-iwlwifi
mesa-utils
libgl1-mesa-dri
xserver-xorg-video-all
xserver-xorg-video-intel
xserver-xorg-video-amdgpu
xserver-xorg-video-nouveau
